## Scope of this license (not part of the license text)

This license covers the ORIGINAL WORK of this project only -- that is, the code
and documents written for the revival effort:

    hook/  server/  updater/  tools/  and the documents in this repository

It does NOT and CANNOT cover the original game "Big Shot" / "PopShot"
(NEXON, published in China by Tiancity), whose contents are reproduced here for
preservation only. All rights in the original game remain with their owners.

## License history (not part of the license text)

Releases up to and including V0.3.1 were published under the GNU General Public
License v3.0. Copies distributed under that license remain under it -- that
cannot be undone. This change applies to this and all later releases.

The reason for the change: GPLv3 explicitly permits selling copies, which does
not match the intent of this project. People have been reselling the game
package to players who did not know it is free. Note that those resellers were
already violating GPLv3 anyway, by shipping neither the source code nor the
license notice.
